OL,7,FWarning: This article contains
OL,8,Fdistressing content
OL,10,FA husband who for years raped his wife
OL,11,Fwhile she was unconscious complained
OL,12,Fthat tablets he was sent for drugging
OL,13,Fher tasted too bitter to slip into her
OL,14,Fcurry and wine, a jury heard.
